title: Text typed at column 3000 of a 5000 column line can be seen where the caret is (pictures only: the file is right either way)
folders: odd-files
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: odd-files/long_line.txt :: (?-i)\Ax{2999}HELLOx{2001}\nshort\n\z

wait 4000
goto long_line.txt
wait 1200
edit long_line.txt 1 3000
type HELLO
wait 600
mark typed-at-3000
wait 500
key save
wait 600
quit
